==Battleground==
*15 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3~12.67 seconds<sup>90f~380f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 22~33.33 seconds<sup>660f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Kerihime (form 2) (Enemy)|Kerihime (form 2)]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 2~30 seconds<sup>60f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~10 seconds<sup>2f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Yurinchi (Enemy)|Yurinchi]] spawns.
**1 [[Princess Head]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use the previous strategies to deal with the combination of enemies in the level. The [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] peons aren't spammed too much and they are at a low magnification, so any AOE units should deal with them easily. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Weightlifter]], [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], or any other [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] units can help easily mow down Shadow Boxer K, if you are having difficulties with her.

